        "### In case of Llama 2, the following prompt template is used for the chat models\n",
        "\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "9JIyct0GUhsG"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "![image.png](data:image/png;base64,)"
      ],
