      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "The special tokens mean:\n",
        "\n",
        "* < s > → start of sequence\n",
        "* [INS ] → beginning of user instruction\n",
        "* [/INST] → end of instruction\n",
        "* << SYS >> ... << /SYS >> → system prompt (behavior/personality)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "okiRz7w_Uswt"
      }
    },
    {
